{
	"name": "Chosen Domain",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/tools/navigation/map-chart-tan.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a guardian of the realm, you must choose a domain to protect and gain a benefit based on what you choose to protect. Select from the following options:</p><p><strong>Desert:</strong> You gain resistance to Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Forest:</strong> You ignore difficult terrain caused by plants.</p><p><strong>Mountain:</strong> You may treat versatile weapons in one hand as if you were using both hands.</p><p><strong>Plains:</strong> You may spur your mount to dash as a bonus action.</p><p><strong>Town:</strong> You gain advantage on Insight checks to recognize danger, including Insight Initiative checks.</p><p><strong>Wetland:</strong> You ignore difficult terrain and forced movement caused by water shallower than your chest.</p>",
